<h2 class="mt-6">Features</h2>
<div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
  <div class="l-ui-card l-ui-card--gradient l-ui-tint-1">
    <h3 class="l-ui-card__title">
      <span class="l-ui-card__icon" style="--l-ui-icon-src: url('<%= asset_path "icon_agent.svg" %>')" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Agent skill</span>
    </h3>
    <p class="l-ui-card__body">Bundled agent skill teaches AI agents to install, configure, and build with <code>layered-assistant-rails</code>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="l-ui-card l-ui-card--gradient l-ui-tint-2">
    <h3 class="l-ui-card__title">
      <span class="l-ui-card__icon" style="--l-ui-icon-src: url('<%= asset_path "icon_cloud.svg" %>')" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Multi-provider and model support</span>
    </h3>
    <p class="l-ui-card__body">Use cloud (Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, Mistral, Groq, OpenRouter, Fireworks) or local (Ollama or LM Studio) providers with configurable models.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="l-ui-card l-ui-card--gradient l-ui-tint-3">
    <h3 class="l-ui-card__title">
      <span class="l-ui-card__icon" style="--l-ui-icon-src: url('<%= asset_path "icon_bolt.svg" %>')" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Streaming responses</span>
    </h3>
    <p class="l-ui-card__body">Real-time streaming via Turbo Streams with dynamic token fade-in, markdown rendered server-side by Kramdown a block at a time, and a stop button to cancel mid-response.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="l-ui-card l-ui-card--gradient l-ui-tint-4">
    <h3 class="l-ui-card__title">
      <span class="l-ui-card__icon" style="--l-ui-icon-src: url('<%= asset_path "icon_chat.svg" %>')" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Conversation UI and side panel</span>
    </h3>
    <p class="l-ui-card__body">Message history, model selection, and conversation switching - either full-screen or in a slide-out panel, wired into your own layout with two helpers.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="l-ui-card l-ui-card--gradient l-ui-tint-5">
    <h3 class="l-ui-card__title">
      <span class="l-ui-card__icon" style="--l-ui-icon-src: url('<%= asset_path "layered_assistant/icon_personas.svg" %>')" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Personas and skills</span>
    </h3>
    <p class="l-ui-card__body">Reusable personas and skills compose into an assistant's system prompt, so behaviour and instructions are written once and shared across assistants.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="l-ui-card l-ui-card--gradient l-ui-tint-1">
    <h3 class="l-ui-card__title">
      <span class="l-ui-card__icon" style="--l-ui-icon-src: url('<%= asset_path "icon_globe.svg" %>')" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Public assistants</span>
    </h3>
    <p class="l-ui-card__body">Publish an assistant to signed-out visitors. Guests chat full-screen with their conversations tracked in the session, no account required.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="l-ui-card l-ui-card--gradient l-ui-tint-2">
    <h3 class="l-ui-card__title">
      <span class="l-ui-card__icon" style="--l-ui-icon-src: url('<%= asset_path "icon_shield.svg" %>')" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Scoped and authorised</span>
    </h3>
    <p class="l-ui-card__body">Every record is stamped with an owner and filtered on read, so users only see their own. Engine routes are blocked by default until you configure an <code>authorize</code> block.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="l-ui-card l-ui-card--gradient l-ui-tint-3">
    <h3 class="l-ui-card__title">
      <span class="l-ui-card__icon" style="--l-ui-icon-src: url('<%= asset_path "icon_lock.svg" %>')" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Encrypted secrets and metrics</span>
    </h3>
    <p class="l-ui-card__body">API keys are encrypted at rest with Active Record Encryption. Messages record tokens, tok/s, time to first token, and the model that actually served the response.</p>
  </div>
</div>
